## Context
fusion_mvp.csv (generated by plot_fusion_mvp.py) has n_reference=176 because it was generated when the reference was at v2.2 (173→176, Kiên Lương added). The rest of the manuscript uses v2.1 (173 plants). The current reference is v2.3 (180 plants). All recall/F1 denominators in the fusion figure use 176, not 173.

## Actions
1. Decide: should fusion analysis use the experiment's locked reference (v2.1 = 173) or the current canonical reference (v2.3 = 180)?
2. Regenerate fusion_mvp.csv, macros_fusion_mvp.tex, fig_fusion_mvp.pdf against the decided reference.
3. Update fig 5 caption in main.md with the correct n_reference and updated metric values if they change.
4. Coordinate with ticket 0458 (master replay) — if 0458 regenerates all figures, this may be resolved there.

## Exit criteria
- [ ] fusion_mvp.csv n_reference matches the reference used for Exp 1/2 scoring
- [ ] Fig 5 caption quotes correct n_reference and consistent metric values
- [ ] All manuscript mentions of "N-plant reference" agree on the same N
